#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-radio-regional-regulations.rst:5
#: 0a845abbc93643b1a661ecc5dfb3285a
msgid "Telemetry Radio Regional Regulations"
msgstr "数传电台区域法规"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-radio-regional-regulations.rst:7
#: d95747af97f14306b13ff26a3e7a3302
msgid ""
"This topic lists the main frequencies available in each country/region, with"
" radios listed."
msgstr "本主题列出了各国家/地区可用的主要频率及对应电台。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-radio-regional-regulations.rst:12
#: a7cf83eda20541a382a8465987137fee
msgid ""
"Compliance is your responsibility. Check that your radios comply with your "
"regional/country regulations for frequency, hopping channels and power "
"levels."
msgstr "合规责任由您自行承担。请确认您的电台符合所在地区/国家关于频率、跳频信道和功率级别的规定。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-radio-regional-regulations.rst:18
#: 528befc308064f5f86a01afe1499778f
msgid ""
"We'd be delighted to add more countries, radios and regulations to this "
"table! Please post the information on the forums, giving links to the "
"applicable regulations and information on what it all means. Also, please "
"point out any inaccuracies in the existing table."
msgstr "欢迎向本表添加更多国家、电台和法规信息！请在论坛发布相关信息，提供适用法规链接及其说明。如发现现有表格中有任何不准确之处，也请指出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-radio-regional-regulations.rst:24
#: c8a4ef2f5f6e40e1a1977da5ef3ae165
msgid "Support for different countries/regions"
msgstr "不同国家/地区的支持情况"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-radio-regional-regulations.rst:26
#: 457b9784567a4fc0aaff8bead1675e9c
msgid ""
"The table below provides links to the applicable standards for users without"
" any special license. If you are have an application specific license or "
"have a HAM license then you should know what rules are applicable to you."
msgstr "下表提供了适用于无特殊许可证用户的相关标准链接。如果您持有特定应用许可证或业余无线电执照，则应了解适用于您的规则。"
